    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "When winter comes, bears go into a “deep sleep” and birds fly south. But what about the bees? They have one "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "main",
            "zh": "最重要的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " job—to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "queen",
            "ref": "v-queen"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " bee!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "To keep the queen bee safe and warm, worker bees "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "stay",
            "ref": "v-stay"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " close together in a "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It is almost as big as a basketball! The queen stays in the middle of the group. It’s the "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " place of their "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "hive",
            "zh": "蜂房"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "; it’s about 27℃. The "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "outer",
            "zh": "外部的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " part is cold; it’s about 8℃. All the worker bees "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "take turns",
            "zh": "轮流"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " from the outside to the inside. So every bee can "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " warm."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Bees need a lot of honey to keep warm all winter. A hive of bees needs about 14 kg of honey to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "live through",
            "ref": "v-live-through"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " winter. To make this much honey, they need to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " more than 60 million flowers!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
